
==========================
 * From theorem premises:
A B C D E F G H I : Points
B,D,C are collinear [00]
DB = DC [01]
B,A,E are collinear [02]
C,F,E are collinear [03]
FE = FC [04]
B,A,G are collinear [05]
GB = GA [06]
H,F,G are collinear [07]
HG = HF [08]
